          "settings": {
            "question": "Can I take this with my existing multivitamin?",
            "answer": "<p>The recommended protocol is 3 to 6 months of daily use. Trace mineral repletion works at the tissue level — not just in blood serum — and takes longer to complete than vitamin supplementation. Clinical research on chromium's effect on blood glucose metabolism and selenium's role in antioxidant enzyme activity both used 8–16 week supplementation windows before measuring outcomes. Consistent daily use over 3–6 months allows the body to rebuild tissue-level mineral reserves fully.</p>"
