            "answer": "<p>At the doses in AIMINERAL — within or at 100% ICMR RDA for each mineral — no mineral exceeds safe daily intake limits. The key caution is against combining AIMINERAL with other supplements that contain the same minerals, particularly selenium (selenosis risk) and zinc (copper depletion risk). Do not exceed one tablet per day. Do not combine with additional trace mineral supplements without physician review.</p>"
